## 🚀 Improvement Description

* **What was improved:**  
  Implementation of software debounce filter (50 ms threshold and 60 ms minimum pulse validation) alongside real-time string accumulation and automatic inactivity timeout closure (5 seconds).

* **Why:**  
  Stage 1 baseline presented mechanical switch bouncing issues causing double-dot inputs, lacked string concatenation for complete words, and required manual reset triggers.

